OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAReform of character references to
OL,4,Abe considered in consultation
OL,5,
OL,6,FStormont's justice minister is looking
OL,7,Fat potential reform of the use of
OL,8,Fcharacter references at sentencing in
OL,9,Fcertain court cases in Northern
OL,10,FIreland.
OL,12,FLast month, Northern Ireland's top
OL,13,Fjudge Dame Siobhan Keegan said there
OL,14,Fwas a "discussion" to be had about
OL,15,Ftheir use, amid concerns from victims
OL,16,Fthat they have no opportunity to
OL,17,Fchallenge them in court.
OL,19,FThe use of character references in
OL,20,Fcertain cases including rape, sexual
OL,21,Fassault and abuse has been debated in
OL,22,FNorthern Ireland for some time.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
