OL,3,GNEWSAReform of character references to
OL,4,Abe considered in consultation
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaunching a public consultation, Naomi
OL,7,FLong said she would explore how quickly
OL,8,Fthe issue can be addressed before this
OL,9,Fassembly term ends next March.
